# StonksSniper development ledger

Status: PERPETUAL
Milestone: All
Dependencies: None

## Purpose
Keep a concise causal engineering record; this ledger is not a feature issue.

## Tasks
- Append substantial decisions, failures, fixes and exact completion evidence.
- Keep technical completion, human acceptance and publication separate.

## Acceptance criteria
- Records describe observed work, not planned work presented as completed.
- No secrets, private context or downloaded market observations are mirrored.

## Completion evidence
- See dated entries for verified implementation and publication. No broker purchase,
  order execution or deployment was performed.

